  "published": "2025-12-11T07:55:20.177Z",
  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 - 接口重构，分离 Modbus 与 Native 协议\n      \n      新增功能：\n      - 新增 Native 协议支持（bool[]、int[] 等原生类型直接映射）\n      - 新增 FrameBuilderFactory 工厂类，简化构建器创建\n      - 新增泛型 WriteFrame<TData> 和 ReadFrame 模型\n      \n      接口变更（Breaking Changes）：\n      - IModbusProtocolCodec<TProtocol> - Modbus 字节编解码\n      - INativeProtocolCodec<TProtocol, TData> - 原生类型编解码\n      - IModbusFrameBuilder<TProtocol> - Modbus 帧构建\n      - INativeFrameBuilder<TProtocol, TData> - Native 帧构建\n      - IModbusDataMapping<TProtocol> - Modbus 批量写入\n      - INativeDataMapping<TProtocol, TData> - Native 批量写入\n      \n      移除：\n      - 移除通用接口 IProtocolCodec、IFrameBuilder、IDataMapping\n      - 移除向后兼容包装类",
